  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "なぜか　♀しか　みつかっていない。\nヤトウモリの　♂を　ひきつれて\nぎゃくハーレムを　つくって　くらす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어찌 된 영문인지 암컷만 발견되고 있다.\n야도뇽의 수컷을 거느리며\n역하렘을 만들어서 산다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不知為何只發現♀。\n率領夜盜火蜥的♂，\n組成逆後宮一起生活。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Curieusement, cette espèce ne compte que\ndes femelles. Ces dernières aiment s’entourer\nde nombreux admirateurs Tritox mâles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bisher wurden nur Weibchen entdeckt.\nSie werden von männlichen Molunk verehrt und\nleben mit einer Gruppe von ihnen zusammen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Por algún motivo desconocido, solo hay\nhembras. Suele formarse su propio harén\ncompuesto por Salandit machos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sono stati trovati solo esemplari femmina,\nche sono soliti circondarsi di maschi\ndi Salandit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "For some reason, only females have been found.\nIt creates a reverse harem of male Salandit that\nit lives with.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なぜか　♀しか　見つかっていない。\nヤトウモリの♂を　引き連れて\n逆ハーレムを　作って　暮らす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不知为何只发现♀。\n率领夜盗火蜥的♂，\n组成逆后宫一起生活。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Por algún motivo desconocido, solo hay\nhembras. Suele formarse su propio harén\ncompuesto por Salandit machos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どくガスには　おおくの　フェロモンが\nふくまれている。　うすめることで\nかんのうてきな　こうすいが　できる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "독가스에는 많은 양의 페로몬이\n포함되어있다. 희석하면\n관능적인 향수가 만들어진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毒瓦斯裡含有很多的費洛蒙。\n稀釋後可用來製作性感的香水。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son gaz toxique est riche en phéromones. Il est\npossible d’isoler ces dernières pour concocter\nun puissant parfum aphrodisiaque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ihr Giftgas enthält viele Pheromone.\nVerdünnt man es, lässt sich daraus\nein sinnliches Parfüm herstellen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su gas venenoso contiene numerosas feromonas.\nAl diluirlo es posible elaborar un perfume que\nresulta verdaderamente embriagador.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il gas tossico che emana contiene feromoni.\nSe viene diluito, se ne ricava un profumo\nche ha un grande potere d’attrazione.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Filled with pheromones, its poisonous gas can\nbe diluted to use in the production of\nluscious perfumes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毒ガスには　多くの　フェロモンが\n含まれている。　薄めることで\n官能的な　香水が　できる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毒瓦斯中含有很多的费洛蒙。\n稀释以后可以制作成性感的香水。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su gas venenoso contiene numerosas feromonas.\nAl diluirlo es posible elaborar un perfume que\nresulta verdaderamente embriagador.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どうくつの　おくふかくに　すみ\nフェロモンで　メロメロに　した\nヤトウモリたちを　はべらせている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "동굴 깊은 곳에서 살며\n페로몬으로 헤롱헤롱하게 만들어\n야도뇽을 시중들게 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在洞窟的深處，\n讓那些被自己的費洛蒙迷住的\n夜盜火蜥們侍奉自己。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon habite au fin fond des cavernes.\nIl se fait servir par des Tritox envoûtés par\nses phéromones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses tief in Höhlen lebende Pokémon hält sich\nmännliche Molunk, die es sich mit Pheromonen\nhörig gemacht hat, als Diener.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en las profundidades de las cuevas.\nGracias a sus feromonas, atrae Salandit y los\nhace presas de su voluntad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive nel profondo delle caverne e si circonda\ndi Salandit che ammalia con i suoi potenti\nferomoni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Salazzle lives deep in caves and forces the\nSalandit it has attracted with its pheromones\nto serve it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "洞窟の　奥深くに　棲み\nフェロモンで　メロメロに　した\nヤトウモリたちを　侍らせている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "居住在洞窟的深处，\n让那些因费洛蒙而着迷的\n夜盗火蜥侍奉自己。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en las profundidades de las cuevas.\nGracias a sus feromonas, atrae Salandit y los\nhace presas de su voluntad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エサが　とれなかった　ヤトウモリを\nほのおが　ふきだす　てのひらで\nはげしく　ビンタし　おしおきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먹이를 잡지 못한 야도뇽은\n불꽃을 뿜어내는 손바닥으로\n세차게 따귀를 때려서 벌을 준다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "對於那些沒捕到獵物的夜盜火蜥，\n焰后蜥會用噴火的手掌猛打\n牠們耳光作為懲罰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Malamandre punit sans merci les Tritox qui\nrentrent bredouilles de la chasse, généralement\nd’une gifle de sa paume enflammée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aus seinen Handflächen schießt Feuer hervor.\nEs verpasst damit Molunk, die keine Beute\nzurückgebracht haben, schallende Ohrfeigen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Castiga a los Salandit que no le traen caza\nabofeteándolos con sus ardientes zarpas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Punisce i Salandit che tornano senza una preda\nschiaffeggiandoli vigorosamente con le zampe\nanteriori che sprigionano fuoco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It punishes Salandit that couldn’t bring it food\nwith a fierce slap of its flame-spewing palm.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エサが　獲れなかった　ヤトウモリを\n炎が　噴き出す　手のひらで\n激しく　ビンタし　お仕置きする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
