      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "对于没有猎获食物的夜盗火蜥，\n焰后蜥会用喷火的手掌猛烈地\n打它们的耳光，以作惩罚。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Castiga a los Salandit que no le traen caza\nabofeteándolos con sus ardientes zarpas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エンニュートは　メスしか　いない。\nフェロモンガスを　はっせいさせて\nオスの　ヤトウモリを　みりょうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
